    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "一个看似专业的名字「Dropout」，背后藏着怎样一个直观问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "随着网络变大，记忆训练集成为实际问题。Dropout 提供了不必改变数据集的简单干预方式。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-dropout-a-simple-way-to-prevent-neural-networks-from-overfitting"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "核心思想是在训练时随机隐藏单元，使隐藏特征不能过度依赖彼此。 关键机制是随机变薄网络进行正则化，它把资料线索与可见的演示行为连接起来。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-dropout-a-simple-way-to-prevent-neural-networks-from-overfitting"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 Dropout 视为简单有效的正则化思想，但其价值取决于架构和规模。它的长期影响在于训练时引入噪声这一原则，如今常与归一化、数据增强和其他正则化方法一起讲解。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-dropout-a-simple-way-to-prevent-neural-networks-from-overfitting"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「Dropout」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
